msgid ""
"0: notified when the alarm opens. 1: when nobody acknowledged level 0 in the escalation time of "
"its severity (Alarm severity rules); and so on, up to 9."
msgstr ""
"0: varsles når alarmen utløses. 1: når ingen har kvittert nivå 0 innen eskaleringstiden for "
